==Portuguese==
{{wikipedia|lang=pt}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|pt}} {{term|posse|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|possum|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{pt-verb||poder}}

# [[can]] (to be able)
#: '''''Posso''' ficar na sua casa.''
#:: '''Can''' I stay at your house.

====Usage notes====
This verb is replaced with ''[[saber]]'' for use with skills (as in to know how to do something) and omitted when relating to verbs of sense.
* "You are allowed to do it." - "Podes faze-lo" (with poder)
* "She is able to swim." - "Ela sabe nadar" (with saber)
* "I am able to see it." - "Eu vejo-o" (omitted)

====Conjugation====
{{pt-conj||poder}}

